        "pt": "Apocalyptic Colossus: o golem do druida Stillin em Kiyamet Grove e o set Aeterna Fatum",
        "en": "Apocalyptic Colossus: the druid Stillin's golem in Kiyamet Grove and the Aeterna Fatum set"
      },
      "x": {
        "pt": "Evento de fim de semana num bosque secreto de Gilead: fale com o Stillin em Kiyamet Grove e derrote os golems (Apocalyptic Colossus, Level 60, e Overcharged Colossus, Level 70) pelo set Apocalyptic Student. Os recursos viram mais itens na Stillin's Shop, liberada depois da quest A Colossal Task. O set Aeterna Fatum, do casamento do príncipe Sidon, está na Featured Gear Shop, e o pacote Apocalyptic Druid (30 itens) é o bônus de upgrade para compras de 10 dólares ou mais. O Harvest Fest e o EbilCorp: Hostile Takeover continuam no Event Hub.",
        "en": "Weekend event in a secret grove in Gilead: talk to Stillin in Kiyamet Grove and defeat the golems (Apocalyptic Colossus, Level 60, and Overcharged Colossus, Level 70) for the Apocalyptic Student set. The resources become more items in Stillin's Shop, unlocked after the A Colossal Task quest. Prince Sidon's wedding set, Aeterna Fatum, is in the Featured Gear Shop, and the Apocalyptic Druid pack (30 items) is the upgrade bonus for purchases of $10 or more. Harvest Fest and EbilCorp: Hostile Takeover continue in the Event Hub."
      },
