        "pt": "Mogloween: o final da Eternal Night em Walpurgisnacht e os raros do evento",
        "en": "Mogloween: the Eternal Night finale in Walpurgisnacht and the event rares"
      },
      "x": {
        "pt": "Parte 3 da Eternal Night Trilogy, com o chefe Father Forest. Os drops saem dos monstros de Walpurgisnacht, os raros de Mogloween estão na Featured Gear Shop e chegaram a PaladinSlayer (2) e a linha CardChaser e CardClasher Ace. As três partes do evento e as recompensas ficam até sexta, 13 de novembro. Na segunda, 2/11, chegaram mais itens: drops do Frankenwerepire em Franken e do Undead Raxgore (Level 75), a Mog-GLOW-ween Merge ampliada com o set Dread Devil e itens de Mogloween Candy Corn na Myx's Candycorn Shop.",
        "en": "Part 3 of the Eternal Night Trilogy, with the boss Father Forest. Drops come from the monsters in Walpurgisnacht, the Mogloween rares are in the Featured Gear Shop, and PaladinSlayer (2) plus the CardChaser and CardClasher Ace line arrived. All three parts of the event and their rewards stay until Friday, November 13. On Monday, Nov 2, more items arrived: drops from Frankenwerepire in Franken and from Undead Raxgore (Level 75), an expanded Mog-GLOW-ween Merge with the Dread Devil set, and Mogloween Candy Corn items in Myx's Candycorn Shop."
      },
